<title>NEW ZEALAND: Nuplex expects steady profit growth in yr.</title>
<headline>Nuplex expects steady profit growth in yr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nuplex Industries Ltd said on Friday its first quarter profit was ahead of last year, and it expected a steady rate of profit growth for the full year to be maintained.</p>
<p>The company said its special waste and Australian business were the main source of profit improvement.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
